# Cra's page probes (theme and background colour, Picture in Picture) answer through Cra Helper,
# never through the page's console: a site's DevTools showed __cra_bg:, __cra_theme: and
# __cra_pip: lines on every load. The fixture counts console calls; the theme colour Cra reads
# shows that the probes ran.
cra://open?url=file://${FIXTURES}/Pages/console.html
expect-log loaded file:
wait 3
cra://action/pictureInPicture
wait 2
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"calls.length+':'+calls.join('|')"}
expect-log Cra cdp Runtime.evaluate .*"value":"0:"
cra://debug?pageColors=1
expect-log page colours theme=.123456 background=.123456
